[pixel_dataset.py:179](/home/maxi7524/repositories/MSIAutoEncoderWrapper/src/msi_autoencoder_wrapper/models/datasets/strategies/pixel_dataset.py:179)

```python
for field in self.target_fields:
```

Dla molekuł tworzy multi-hot:

```python
